    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71737" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξῠλο-κόπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκόπτὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hewing, felling wood,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλεκυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.2.36
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυλοτόμος</span>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόπος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>wood-feller,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				9.27(21)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pecking wood,</i> of the birds <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελεός</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνιπολόγος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				593a9
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
